# @xlibraries packages come from GitHub Packages (docs/streams-plan.md §4). The token is read from the environment:
# CI's own token when publishing; GITHUB_PACKAGES_TOKEN (a token with read:packages) on Vercel and on your machine,
# needed only once a package pins a published @xlibraries version instead of the workspace copy.
@xlibraries:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_PACKAGES_TOKEN}
